Require changes

Set Shell "zsh"
Set Theme "Catppuccin Macchiato"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1280
Set Height 760
Set Padding 18
Set Framerate 20
Set TypingSpeed 25ms

Sleep 1s

Type "changes interactive --no-notes --no-symbols --no-calls --no-groups --quiet"
Enter
Wait+Screen /changes/
Sleep 2s
Type "f"
Sleep 2s
Type "d"
Sleep 2s
Type ":"
Type "layout side-by-side"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "q"
